<title>UK: Kommuninvest sets $50 million two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Kommuninvest sets $50 million two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOMMUNINVEST I SVERIGE</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     4.30	MATURITY    30.OCT.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	REDEMPTION IN DOLLARS WITH LIMITED FOREX PROTECTION</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
